  "description": "Mockly is a single binary that mocks HTTP, gRPC, Kafka, AMQP, MQTT, Redis, SMTP, and a dozen other protocols for integration tests — one process instead of a dozen Docker containers. Mockly.Driver is the C# client: it downloads the right platform binary automatically, starts/stops the server from your test process, and gives you a typed API to register mocks, inject faults, and manage scenarios.",
